<title>USA: TABLE-Lowe's Cos Inc Q2 net higher.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Lowe's Cos Inc Q2 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH WILKESBORO, N.C. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.73		    $0.67</p>
<p> Net			 126,496		  114,279</p>
<p> Revs		    2,808,086		2,459,008</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  174,121		  163,363</p>
<p>	  (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE : Six months net $196.9 million vs $161.3 million. Other six-month figures not available.</p>
<p>Capital budget target for 1997 is $1 billion, inclusive of capital leases. Of this, more than $800 million is planned for store expansion. Current plans are to finance the expansion program through funds from operations, leases, issuance of $58 million in stock to ESOP, and external financing.</p>
</text>
